<section class="page-head">
<div class="sigil-lg" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path d="M6 26 A14 14 0 0 1 34 26"/><circle cx="20" cy="26" r="2" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><path d="M6 32 Q13 27 20 32 T34 32"/></svg></div>
<div>
<h1>The Listening Studio</h1>
<p class="sub">One theme, six ways of hearing</p>
</div>
</section>

<main class="reading">
<p class="lede">This page walks through one short original theme six times, each time through a different lens — Melody, Rhythm, Timbre, Texture, Harmony, and Form. For each lens, listen once with no diagram, then replay with the simple visual guide.</p>
<p class="measure">These six lenses are the listening skills behind three threads you'll meet throughout the music units: <strong>Texture &amp; Voices</strong>, <strong>Consonance &amp; Dissonance</strong>, and <strong>Structure &amp; Freedom</strong>.</p>
<nav class="overview" aria-label="The six listening lenses">
<button class="ocard" type="button" data-lens="melody" style="--acc:#6F5E95;--acc-soft:#EFE9F5"><span class="ohead"><span class="onum">01</span><span class="osig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 26 A 14 14 0 0 1 34 26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="6" cy="26" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="34" cy="26" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span></span><span class="oname">Melody</span><span class="ot">The shape of a line</span><span class="ofoot"><span class="othread-sig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M6 20 A 14 14 0 0 1 34 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="28" y2="20" stroke-dasharray="2 2" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><span class="othread">Consonance &amp; Dissonance</span></span></button>
<button class="ocard" type="button" data-lens="harmony" style="--acc:#6F5E95;--acc-soft:#EFE9F5"><span class="ohead"><span class="onum">02</span><span class="osig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M6 20 A 14 14 0 0 1 34 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="28" y2="20" stroke-dasharray="2 2" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span></span><span class="oname">Harmony</span><span class="ot">Tension, and where it lands</span><span class="ofoot"><span class="othread-sig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M6 20 A 14 14 0 0 1 34 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="28" y2="20" stroke-dasharray="2 2" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><span class="othread">Consonance &amp; Dissonance</span></span></button>
