<button class="ocard" type="button" data-lens="texture" style="--acc:#574878;--acc-soft:color-mix(in oklab,#574878 12%,white)"><span class="ohead"><span class="onum">04</span><span class="osig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20 Q 10 12, 16 20 T 28 20 T 40 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="10" cy="16" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="22" cy="24" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="34" cy="16" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span></span><span class="oname">Texture</span><span class="ot">How many voices, at once</span><span class="ofoot"><span class="othread-sig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20 Q 10 12, 16 20 T 28 20 T 40 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="10" cy="16" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="22" cy="24" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="34" cy="16" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><span class="othread">Texture &amp; Voices</span></span></button>
<button class="ocard" type="button" data-lens="rhythm" style="--acc:#8C80AE;--acc-soft:color-mix(in oklab,#8C80AE 12%,white)"><span class="ohead"><span class="onum">05</span><span class="osig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="6" y1="30" x2="34" y2="30"/><line x1="13" y1="9" x2="13" y2="30" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6"/><line x1="27" y1="9" x2="27" y2="30" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6"/><rect x="7" y="18" width="5" height="12" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><rect x="16" y="24" width="5" height="6" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><rect x="25" y="14" width="5" height="16" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/></svg></span></span><span class="oname">Rhythm</span><span class="ot">Sound and silence, grouped</span><span class="ofoot"><span class="othread-sig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20 Q 9 14, 14 20 Q 19 26, 24 20 Q 29 14, 34 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><line x1="14" y1="10" x2="14" y2="30" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6" stroke="currentColor"/><line x1="24" y1="10" x2="24" y2="30" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="9" cy="20" r=".9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="19" cy="20" r=".9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="29" cy="20" r=".9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><span class="othread">Structure &amp; Freedom</span></span></button>
<button class="ocard" type="button" data-lens="form" style="--acc:#8C80AE;--acc-soft:color-mix(in oklab,#8C80AE 12%,white)"><span class="ohead"><span class="onum">06</span><span class="osig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="7" x2="12" y2="31" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6"/><line x1="22" y1="7" x2="22" y2="31" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6"/><rect x="5" y="16" width="6" height="12" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><rect x="14" y="16" width="6" height="12" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none;opacity:.55"/><rect x="29" y="5" width="6" height="23" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/></svg></span></span><span class="oname">Form</span><span class="ot">The whole shape of a piece</span><span class="ofoot"><span class="othread-sig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20 Q 9 14, 14 20 Q 19 26, 24 20 Q 29 14, 34 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><line x1="14" y1="10" x2="14" y2="30" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6" stroke="currentColor"/><line x1="24" y1="10" x2="24" y2="30" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6" stroke="currentColor"/><circle cx="9" cy="20" r=".9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="19" cy="20" r=".9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="29" cy="20" r=".9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><span class="othread">Structure &amp; Freedom</span></span></button>
</nav>
<div id="lens-detail" class="lens-detail is-hidden" aria-live="polite">
<div class="detail-bar"><span class="dthread" id="dThread"></span><button class="detail-close" id="dClose" type="button">← All lenses</button></div>
<div class="lens-wrap is-hidden" data-lens="rhythm" style="--acc:#8C80AE;--acc-soft:color-mix(in oklab,#8C80AE 12%,white)">
<section class="lens" id="lens-rhythm">
<div class="lens-head">
<span class="lens-sig" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="6" y1="30" x2="34" y2="30"/><line x1="13" y1="9" x2="13" y2="30" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6"/><line x1="27" y1="9" x2="27" y2="30" stroke-dasharray="1.5 2.5" opacity=".6"/><rect x="7" y="18" width="5" height="12" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><rect x="16" y="24" width="5" height="6" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><rect x="25" y="14" width="5" height="16" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/></svg></span>
<div><span class="lens-idx">01 · Rhythm</span><h2 class="lens-title">Sound and silence, grouped</h2></div>
</div>
<p class="lens-q"><em>Are the note starts even, or grouped unevenly?</em></p>
<p class="lens-cue">Rhythm is how a phrase divides time — which sounds are long, which are short, and where the silences fall. Listen for long sounds, quick turns, and spaces.</p>
<div class="realmusic viz-embed">
<div class="realmusic-head"><span class="rm-tag">Basic concept</span><span class="rm-work">One phrase · Long, short, and space · Even steps</span></div>
<p class="rm-intro">The same seventeen pitches, organized two ways in time. One version stretches, snaps short, and leaves audible <em>space</em>; the other advances in equal steps. Only one plays at a time — watch the shared pulse grid underneath.</p>
<div id="rhythm-long-short-even-motion">
  <style>
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion { color:var(--foreground); font-size:var(--font-size-base); }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .shared-claim { margin:0 0 1.4rem; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .shared-claim strong { font-weight:500; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .clip { margin:0 0 1.2rem; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .clip-title { display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; margin:0 0 .5rem; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .clip-title strong { font-weight:500; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .clip-title span { color:var(--muted-foreground); }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion audio { display:block; width:100%; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .stage { display:block; width:100%; margin:.7rem 0 0; overflow:visible; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .stage text { fill:var(--foreground); font-family:inherit; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .stage .muted { fill:var(--muted-foreground); }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .pulse { stroke:var(--border); stroke-width:1; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .pulse.measure { stroke:var(--muted-foreground); stroke-width:1.5; opacity:.62; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .lane-guide { stroke:var(--border); stroke-width:1.25; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .now { stroke:var(--foreground); stroke-width:2.5; opacity:.88; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .rhythm-row { opacity:.7; transition:opacity .16s linear; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .rhythm-row.active { opacity:1; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .rhythm-row.inactive { opacity:.18; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .row-label { transition:opacity .16s linear; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .row-label.inactive { opacity:.34; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .sound-block { opacity:.34; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .sound-block.reached { opacity:.72; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .sound-block.current { fill:var(--foreground); opacity:1; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .sound-block.shaped { fill:var(--viz-series-2,var(--primary)); }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .sound-block.even { fill:var(--viz-series-1,var(--primary)); }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .ending-space { fill:var(--muted); stroke:var(--border); stroke-width:1; opacity:.62; }
    #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .space-hatch { stroke:var(--muted-foreground); stroke-width:1.25; opacity:.3; }
    @media (max-width:620px) {
      #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .clip-title { display:block; }
      #rhythm-long-short-even-motion .stage text { font-size:22px; }
    }
  </style>

  <p class="shared-claim"><strong>Same pitches, different timing:</strong> one version stretches, snaps short, and leaves space; the other advances in equal steps.</p>
  <p class="sr-only">Two piano versions use the same seventeen pitches. The first alternates long sounds, quick turns, and clear spaces. The second begins each sound at an even interval and retains a visible final span of silence.</p>

  <section class="clip" aria-labelledby="shaped-rhythm-title">
    <p class="clip-title" id="shaped-rhythm-title"><strong>Long, short, and space</strong><span>sound lengths shape the phrase</span></p>
    <audio id="shaped-rhythm-audio" controls preload="metadata"><source src="/guides/listening-studio/audio/viz/question-answer-return--rhythm-shaped.m4a" type="audio/mp4"></audio>
  </section>

  <section class="clip" aria-labelledby="even-rhythm-title">
    <p class="clip-title" id="even-rhythm-title"><strong>Even steps</strong><span>equal spacing makes the motion steadier</span></p>
    <audio id="even-rhythm-audio" controls preload="metadata"><source src="/guides/listening-studio/audio/viz/question-answer-return--rhythm-even.m4a" type="audio/mp4"></audio>
  </section>

  <svg id="basic-rhythm-stage" class="stage" viewBox="0 0 760 306" role="img" aria-labelledby="basic-rhythm-svg-title basic-rhythm-svg-desc">
    <title id="basic-rhythm-svg-title">Long-and-short rhythm compared with evenly spaced steps</title>
    <desc id="basic-rhythm-svg-desc">Seventeen sounds appear in two aligned rows over a steady twenty-beat pulse. Block widths show sound length and gaps show space. The even row ends with a visibly retained span of silence. A moving now line follows the selected recording.</desc>
    <text class="muted" x="150" y="24">steady pulse</text>
    <g class="pulse-grid"></g>
    <line class="lane-guide" x1="150" y1="106" x2="728" y2="106"></line>
    <line class="lane-guide" x1="150" y1="206" x2="728" y2="206"></line>
    <text class="row-label" data-version-label="shaped" x="16" y="101">long · short · space</text>
    <text class="row-label" data-version-label="even" x="16" y="201">even steps</text>
    <g class="rhythm-row" data-version="shaped"></g>
    <g class="rhythm-row" data-version="even"></g>
    <g class="space-region"></g>
    <line class="now" x1="150" y1="40" x2="150" y2="240"></line>
    <text class="muted now-label" x="150" y="258" text-anchor="middle">now</text>
    <text class="muted" x="150" y="292">block width = sound length · gap = space</text>
  </svg>

  <p class="sr-only" data-listening-live aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Both rhythm versions are ready.</p>

  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
      const root=document.getElementById('rhythm-long-short-even-motion');
      const svg=root.querySelector('#basic-rhythm-stage');
      const shapedAudio=root.querySelector('#shaped-rhythm-audio');
      const evenAudio=root.querySelector('#even-rhythm-audio');
      const allAudio=[shapedAudio,evenAudio];
      const ns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';
      const tempo=112,beatSeconds=60/tempo,totalBeats=20,xStart=150,xWidth=578;
      const shapedDuration=8.571,evenDuration=10.714;
      const xForBeat=beat=>xStart+Math.max(0,Math.min(totalBeats,beat))/totalBeats*xWidth;
      const xForTime=time=>xForBeat(time/beatSeconds);
      const make=(name,attrs={})=>{const node=document.createElementNS(ns,name);Object.entries(attrs).forEach(([key,value])=>node.setAttribute(key,value));return node;};
      const shaped=[
        [0,1.45],[1.75,.25],[2.10,.25],[2.50,.78],[3.45,.40],
        [4,1.25],[5.50,.25],[5.85,.25],[6.35,1.25],
        [8,1.40],[9.70,.25],[10.05,.25],[10.45,1.05],[11.70,.45],
        [12.50,.85],[13.65,.25],[14.25,1.55]
      ];
      const even=Array.from({length:17},(_,index)=>[index,.54]);

      const pulseGrid=svg.querySelector('.pulse-grid');
      for(let beat=0;beat<=totalBeats;beat+=1){
        const x=xForBeat(beat);
        pulseGrid.appendChild(make('line',{class:`pulse${beat%4===0?' measure':''}`,x1:x.toFixed(2),x2:x.toFixed(2),y1:'42',y2:'232'}));
      }

      const buildRow=(selector,events,y,className)=>{
        const group=svg.querySelector(selector);
        events.forEach(([start,duration])=>{
          const x=xForBeat(start),width=Math.max(7,xForBeat(start+duration)-x);
          group.appendChild(make('rect',{class:`sound-block ${className}`,'data-start':(start*beatSeconds).toFixed(6),'data-end':((start+duration*.94)*beatSeconds).toFixed(6),x:x.toFixed(2),y:String(y),width:width.toFixed(2),height:'38',rx:'6'}));
        });
      };
      buildRow('.rhythm-row[data-version="shaped"]',shaped,78,'shaped');
      buildRow('.rhythm-row[data-version="even"]',even,178,'even');

      const spaceStartBeat=17,spaceX=xForBeat(spaceStartBeat),spaceEnd=xForBeat(20);
      const spaceGroup=svg.querySelector('.space-region');
      spaceGroup.appendChild(make('rect',{class:'ending-space',x:spaceX.toFixed(2),y:'174',width:(spaceEnd-spaceX).toFixed(2),height:'46',rx:'6'}));
      for(let x=spaceX+10;x<spaceEnd;x+=14)spaceGroup.appendChild(make('line',{class:'space-hatch',x1:x.toFixed(2),x2:(x+10).toFixed(2),y1:'216',y2:'178'}));
      const spaceLabel=make('text',{class:'muted',x:((spaceX+spaceEnd)/2).toFixed(2),y:'170','text-anchor':'middle'});spaceLabel.textContent='ending space';spaceGroup.appendChild(spaceLabel);

      let activeVersion=null;
      const setActive=version=>{
        activeVersion=version;
        svg.querySelectorAll('.rhythm-row').forEach(row=>{row.classList.toggle('active',row.dataset.version===version);row.classList.toggle('inactive',version&&row.dataset.version!==version);});
        svg.querySelectorAll('[data-version-label]').forEach(label=>label.classList.toggle('inactive',version&&label.dataset.versionLabel!==version));
        spaceGroup.style.opacity=version==='shaped'?'.24':'1';
      };
      const paintRow=(audio,version,duration)=>{
        const time=Math.max(0,Math.min(duration,audio.currentTime||0));
        const atIdleStart=audio.paused&&time===0;
        svg.querySelectorAll(`.rhythm-row[data-version="${version}"] [data-start][data-end]`).forEach(block=>{
          const start=Number(block.dataset.start),end=Number(block.dataset.end);
          block.classList.toggle('reached',!atIdleStart&&time>=start);
          block.classList.toggle('current',!atIdleStart&&time>=start&&time<end);
        });
        if(activeVersion===version){const x=xForTime(time);svg.querySelector('.now').setAttribute('x1',x);svg.querySelector('.now').setAttribute('x2',x);svg.querySelector('.now-label').setAttribute('x',x);}
      };
      const shapedStatus=time=>{
        if(time<.938)return 'Shaped rhythm: a long opening sound.';
        if(time<1.607)return 'Shaped rhythm: quick turns follow the opening.';
        if(time<2.143)return 'Shaped rhythm: a clear space separates the next phrase.';
        if(time<3.938)return 'Shaped rhythm: long sounds, quick turns, and spaces alternate.';
        if(time<7.634)return 'Shaped rhythm: the contrasting lengths continue.';
        return 'Shaped rhythm: the final sound is held.';
      };
      const evenStatus=time=>{
        if(time<8.571)return 'Even rhythm: each pitch begins on the next equal step.';
        if(time<9.051)return 'Even rhythm: the final step sounds and fades.';
        return 'Even rhythm: the retained ending space remains visible.';
      };
      [['shaped',shapedAudio],['even',evenAudio]].forEach(([version,audio])=>{
        audio.addEventListener('play',()=>setActive(version));
        audio.addEventListener('seeking',()=>setActive(version));
      });
      window.ListeningVisual.wire({root,audio:shapedAudio,paint:()=>paintRow(shapedAudio,'shaped',shapedDuration),peers:allAudio,status:shapedStatus,initialStatus:shapedStatus(0)});
      window.ListeningVisual.wire({root,audio:evenAudio,paint:()=>paintRow(evenAudio,'even',evenDuration),peers:allAudio,status:evenStatus,initialStatus:evenStatus(0)});
      setActive(null);
    })();
  </script>
  <p class="model-note">Simplified listening model: both rows contain the same pitch sequence. Blocks represent sound lengths and their spacing; the vertical lines represent a steady pulse. This is not notation.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="realmusic viz-embed">
<div class="realmusic-head"><span class="rm-tag">In real music</span><span class="rm-work">Beethoven, Symphony No. 5 · the Charleston</span></div>
<p class="rm-intro">Two famous rhythms crossing a fixed <em>now</em> line. Beethoven repeatedly bunches three short notes into a held landing; the Charleston keeps shifting its accents around a steady pulse. Play either clip and the stream scrolls past in real time.</p>
<div id="rhythm-note-stream-motion">
  <style>
    #rhythm-note-stream-motion { color:var(--foreground); font-size:var(--font-size-base); }
    #rhythm-note-stream-motion .clip { margin:0 0 1.5rem; }
    #rhythm-note-stream-motion .clip p { margin:0 0 .5rem; }
    #rhythm-note-stream-motion audio { width:100%; }
    #rhythm-note-stream-motion .stage { display:block; width:100%; margin:.5rem 0 0; }
    #rhythm-note-stream-motion text { fill:var(--foreground); font-family:inherit; }
    #rhythm-note-stream-motion .pulse-line { stroke:var(--border); stroke-width:2; }
