  <p class="shared-claim"><strong>One four-bar theme, two organizing logics:</strong> the fugue passes it among voices; sonata form sends it through contrast, development, and return.</p>
  <p class="sr-only">Two compact piano miniatures use the same Question, Answer, Return theme. The fugue model layers successive subject entries in three voices. The sonata-form model presents Theme A, a modulating bridge, Theme B, development, and recapitulation.</p>

