<p class="lens-q"><em>Who — or what — is making the sound?</em></p>
<p class="lens-cue">Timbre is tone color — the quality that lets you tell instruments apart even when they play the exact same line. The line stays the same; notice how each sound begins, holds, rings, and fades.</p>
