<p class="lens-q"><em>How many independent layers are active, and what does each one do?</em></p>
<p class="lens-cue">Texture describes how many layers are sounding together and how they relate. Watch for a new role entering, not just for the music getting louder: a main melody is joined by a low sustained foundation, a plucked repeating support, and finally a high responding line that moves independently around the melody.</p>
