<p class="lens-q"><em>Does the harmonic journey come home, or land somewhere else?</em></p>
<p class="lens-cue">Harmony is a journey away from a home chord and (often) back to it. Both clips use the same melody and leave the same home — listen for whether the ending gets back there.</p>
